        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's getting late, Pallas. We should split up and make our own preparations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you really sure about this, Titi?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Ever since Behnui learned the harp was a fake, he's had it under guard by our retinue. He's not letting me get anywhere near it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's definitely going to post more guards tonight so nothing unexpected happens, but it'll be a different story tomorrow when the exchange ceremony takes place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "He'll have to leave it exposed in public, which is where we'll find our chance...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what comes next?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Next? The Sargonian government will probably give a formal apology about the whole affair, while sending more diplomats to discuss things with the Astynomos in private.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "On the outside, it will look like a Sargonian mission taking a Minoan national treasure and fleeing, but the people in charge of both nations will know that all they lost was a fake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not what my question was about, Titi. I want to know what will happen to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take the fake harp and Mio and leave via the ancient route. Can't go back to Menat-Ha'mait, Padishah Khery's guards would definitely chase me across the entire city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I really do get caught, then it doesn't matter if it's by Behnui or Padishah Khery. Either one would most likely eliminate any inconvenient evidence, then push the blame onto Minos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#14$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll have to keep running. Only then would Sargon's lofty nobles not dare look too deeply into this 'burglary' without authorization. What I will carry away with me is not just a fake harp, but the truth as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Titi...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, no trying to talk me out of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm all for better ideas, believe me. I don't really want to carry a big, heavy harp around Terra either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go home, Pallas. Let me be alone for a while. I'll see you tomorrow morning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
