    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Titi leans against the back of a seat in the plaza, and looks up.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The night sky is always perfectly clear in Minos, a great boon to stargazers. It is this heavenly advantage that caused the ancient Minoans to associate their heroes with the positions of the stars.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 23,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "When she was young, Titi's father would look up at the stars and tell her the stories of these heroes.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 23,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Some you can find in the history books. As for those with no source, perhaps they were simply cooked up by her underachieving bookworm of a father.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 23,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Though illness took him from this land prematurely, Titi still remembers clearly every story he told her.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 23,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Within those tales, those tales of Minos, will she find one of an exiled hero carrying a fake harp?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 23,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Countless stars sparkle silently in the dark sky. Titi does not find her answer.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 23,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
