    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's late, I clocked out a long time ago. Whatever it is, it can wait until my shift tomorrow\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is I, Grammate\u00fas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kassandra?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forgive me, I know you are resting at the moment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Err... May I ask why you have deigned to visit me in the middle of the night?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wished to know if the Astynomos has told you anything regarding the theft involving Master Xanthos and his apprentice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had called upon the Astynomos' office earlier to discuss the ceremonial play with her, and when I mentioned the case from a few days ago, she became evasive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, the Astynomos most likely has her own concerns. It's the exchange ceremony tomorrow, after all. She not only has to deal with the entire process, but also the Sargonian delegation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Therein lies my worries.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the delegation were to ask for the case to be re-examined in the name of bilateral trust, as the Astynomos is in charge of diplomacy, Lydia could hardly refuse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I could tell she was a little tense while we were talking, and her side desk had piles of Minoan law codices and incident investigation reports.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "She most likely is already having her hand twisted by the envoy. This means the charges against Xanthos and his apprentice will only become more severe, and...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "And?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it were not for your schoolmate's Oripathy nearing a crisis point, I do not believe there would be a Vulpo tail behind your sofa's armrest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We finally meet, Lena Athopoulou, head of the Rhodes Island branch office.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Yeia sas, Kassandra...</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Xanthos and Lykeion are her patients. She simply wished to give them their medicine while they are jailed, so she came to me for help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Came to you for help? If this were any ordinary jailing, she should have no difficulty in sending medicine to convicts if she so wished.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems my conjectures were not too far from the mark. Lydia really is going to punish those two heavily to satisfy Sargon's demands. They have most likely already been moved to death row.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never thought Hi\u00e9reia Kassandra, dream interpreter of Endymion Temple, would be so skilled in reasoning...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should know, Hek\u00e1demos, that not even the Astynomos' Grammate\u00fas can visit prisoners on death row.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unless you entertain some very dangerous ideas, such as...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A jailbreak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't have Lykeion and his master dying in prison from an Oripathy attack. They might have done wrong, but the punishment is too severe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have not visited me tonight, Kassandra, and do not know about the sentencing on this case...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could I ask you to help us keep things discreet? If all the heroes are up in the sky watching us, they would not sit idly by and allow something so ridiculous to happen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you doing this to save lives as well, Lena?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#18$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to save my patients, and 'save' my sister. I understand she has her ambitions as Astynomos, but she has burdens to bear too, and she cannot keep making mistakes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The eyes of the people will be on the exchange ceremony tomorrow. I've already obtained the prison blueprints through personal connections, and I have a route.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So long as we get them out, even if it's just to jab an emergency inhibitor into them, it'll be worth it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A route is not enough. You need someone to buy you time at both the Astynomos' office and the prison.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go find Lydia. As for the prison...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can help you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "58_g14_yanprison",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "K\u00fdrios, you said that nothing truly belongs to the Minoans... but how can that be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The burdenbeasts we herd, you seen them before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "text": "The scarves and veils draped on their heads we use to control what they see, are they not a Sargonian invention?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, I am afraid you are off on the symbology of those scarves. Those are actually\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, don't try to give me something like 'they are a subtle reference to the scarves the Sargonians forced us to wear during the occupation'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "text": "What difference is there between ridicule and praise? Are they both not marks they have left on Minoan culture?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I fail to see how you can conflate the two...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still being stubborn, are you? Then let us speak of the ground beneath our feet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "text": "More than a hundred years ago, Minos spread its roots, drinking deep of this paradise of rivers, but now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Padishah Malla, Queen of the Far Shore, gathered the engineers of Sargon and Minos alongside countless laborers, moving three poleis atop steel tracks. Athenius is far, far away from its former resting place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is obvious sophistry. Even if the Sargonians had not come, we would have eventually moved our cities onto nomadic plates ourselves. It's the inevitable march of technology...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, well said! Have you spent time at Theros Temple, boy? However, there is one point you have overlooked: the very language we are using in this debate, right now, is 'mixed'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "text": "The old tongue of Minos was eroded away during the occupation. The modern Minoan language the priests worked so hard to assemble, how many words do you think were taken from the nation you so hate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#12$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#3$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You do not understand the man's meaning, Lykeion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no removing the scars of war. A truce does not mean everything is in the past. We can no longer fight for the Minos in our hearts, for it no longer exists.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You, with the helmet. You're actually somewhat interesting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Judging by your age, you could not have experienced the occupation yourself, but your words reveal a deep understanding of the period...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do not waste precious time guessing at the history of strangers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just a tramp who doesn't care if he dies on the street or in prison. I once had a decent son, but he was stolen away by his dreams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#4$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dreams?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2076_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "One morning, nine years ago, he ran out of his room, shaking me out of my hangover, telling me he had dreamed of a river, and that he should set off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "text": "A river running red with blood. *sigh* I did not have to visit the priests of Endymion Temple to understand its meaning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that boy was not trying to get away from me, then he was thirsting for battle. He forgot what our ancestors had experienced, and forgot why his father is a useless, drunken gambler.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Beggar?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Divine revelation... A river red with blood...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#2$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You are Ithakos's father?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
