    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$warm_intro",
        "key": "$warm_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": 1,
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Titi! Why're you back so late?! I thought you were busy 'fleeing from justice'!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We might actually have to flee from justice, Mio.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We <i>what?!</i> You spent all that time walking about to come up with this <i>brilliant</i> plan, and you want me to suffer alongside you?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#14$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take the fake harp far, far away, and place all the wrongs on one person's 'theft'. That's the best way to resolve this I can think of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's certainly not the <i>best</i> way, but it's definitely the most Medjehtiqedti way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Three weeks ago, when the delegation left Sargon, you said you wanted to experience the route Kereseira took when going to Athenius for the first time, so you followed the ancient route, even though it was a massive pain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "You could <i>see</i> Behnui's guards talking shit about you, but you didn't want to make a scene, and you were worried they wouldn't treat the relic right, so you took that big, heavy harp with you. By yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "And there was that time a few months ago in Menat-Ha'mait when you were helping that Pepe girl out of a bind. You went and poured an entire jug of wine all over yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "We both know you spent a long time grumbling to me about that afterwards, saying stuff like how a curator's salary isn't enough for all that dry cleaning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you didn't blame Pepe. After all, you believe this is what friends should do for each other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If all your best ideas keep ending up with you taking on the burden yourself, then you should just quit already!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pfft...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's so funny, huh?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing, it's just that after hearing your words, I'm even more convinced I'm doing the right thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like how Xanthos and Lykeion did not wish for a relic that is rightfully Minos's to be used as a diplomatic bargaining chip, so they stole it, bearing all the consequences.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I might not understand their true intents, but I believe their deeds are worthy of being recorded in the tales of the heroes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now, I'm just a copycat. I don't dare assume I understand what makes someone a hero, but I want to write my own tale...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if I can't be considered a real hero, even if the protagonist of this story can only run away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never expected you to come to such a realization, Kyr\u00eda Mashayer...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kassandra?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you not blame Xanthos and his apprentice, who attempted to steal the harp? If it were not for their meddling, your cultural exchange would have gone smoothly, even if what you have is but a fake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could I blame them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a feeling Behnui will try to seize the initiative to pressure the Astynomos into handing down an unjust sentence... but it's those two who reveal the truth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I can shift the focus of the issue onto myself by stealing the fake, and free both Xanthos and Lykeion, then it'll all be worth it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, how do you know the harp the Sargonian delegation brought is a replica?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
